        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Electricity, high voltage, production UCTE, at grid</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Electricity, high voltage, production UCTE, at grid
This dataset describes the transmission of high voltage electricity.;
UUID: 8374adc5-28d9-39c3-9384-829195688a0f
Included are the electricity production using , the transmission network and direct emissions to air (ozone and N2O). Electricity losses are accounted for.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Average technology used to transmit and distribute electricity. Includes underground and overhead lines. Electricity production according to related datasets
Time period: Statistics for 2008
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_8374adc5-28d9-39c3-9384-829195688a0f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
